  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kangalita Irrigation Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture.Beneficiaries: Post-conflict farming community.Summary: The project funds will be used to complete a feasibility study to assess the best options for rehabilitating and expanding existing irrigation infrastructure on Kangalita&apos;s farm. The grant will also fund training in ADF&apos;s required bookkeeping; monitoring and evaluation; governance and financial management; types of irrigation technologies; and an exchange visit to learn from other working farms.</narrative>
  </description>
